OL,3,ADog rescued from cliff ledge at
OL,4,Alandmark waterfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog stranded on a narrow ledge at the
OL,7,Fbottom of a 40ft (12m) cliff next to a
OL,8,Fwaterfall has been safely retrieved
OL,9,Fthanks to the efforts of a
OL,10,Fvolunteer-run rescue team.
OL,12,FYorkshire Dales charity Cave Rescue
OL,13,FOrganisation (CRO) and North Yorkshire
OL,14,FFire and Rescue responded to the
OL,15,Fincident at the well-known Pecca Falls,
OL,16,Fin Ingleton, after 15:15 BST on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,19,FEight-year-old Labrador Penny had
OL,20,Ffallen into the river before becoming
OL,21,Fstuck after climbing up to a rocky
OL,22,Foutcrop 6.5ft (2m) above the water.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
