OL,3,ADog rescued from cliff ledge at
OL,4,Alandmark waterfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FUsing a rope system, a volunteer was
OL,7,Flowered to the ledge to reach the dog
OL,8,Fbefore she was "hauled back up the
OL,9,Fgorge where she was reunited with her
OL,10,Fowners".
